---
import '../styles/styles.css'; // Importa seu CSS global
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - Estação Não Encontrada | Sampa 4u</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200" />
    <link rel="icon" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rafabs/SP-4-u/main/Mapa_dos_Trilhos/Favicon/SP4U_LOGO.ico" type="image/x-icon">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-wrapper">
        <div class="error-container">
            <div class="error-icon">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 4rem; color: #ffcc00;">traffic</span>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 5rem;">train</span>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 4rem; color: #ff4444;">wrong_location</span>
            </div>
            <h1>404</h1>
            <h2>Ops... Estação Não Encontrada :(</h2>
            <p>Parece que o trem mudou de rota ou esta linha ainda está em obras.</p>

            <a href="/" class="btn-home">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="vertical-align: middle;">arrow_back</span> 
                Por favor, embarque no próximo trem (Início)
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <style>
        .error-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: var(--bg-color, #0f0f0f);
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .error-container {
            max-width: 500px;
        }
        .error-icon {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 6rem;
            margin: 0;
            color: #333;
        }
        h2 {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #555;
        }
        p {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            color: #777;
        }
        .btn-home {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background-color: #0078D4;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: transform 0.2s, background-color 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-home:hover {
            background-color: #005a9e;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
    </style>
</body>
</html>